[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "鍛錬そっちのけになるような楽しいこと……\nうーん、何があるかな",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "この島には色んな遊具とか施設があるけど、\nどうせならアタシたちだけの特別なことがいいなぁ……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "……姉様、目的の場所についたわ。\nここなら釣りが許可されている",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "よし！　釣りしながら考えて、夜ご飯の食材調達して、\n時間を有効活用しやしょうや！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "いい魚が獲れたら、それでごちそうとか作っちゃう？\n美味しいご飯も、いい思い出になるよね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "姉様の料理なら、なんでもどこでも、ごちそうだわ。\n……あれ？　あそこ見て",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "クリセルダ",
    "romanized_name": "Criselda",
    "model_path_hash": 2525735515103399113,
    "text": "噂の真相を確かめる時が来たわ……\nさぁ、いつでもかかってらっしゃい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3779970044504570002,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "アンチュ",
    "romanized_name": "Antje",
    "model_path_hash": 1263802190917653320,
    "text": "調合した「パイ風撒き餌」もバッチリよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7101962426125413487,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "クリセルダ",
    "romanized_name": "Criselda",
    "model_path_hash": 2525735515103399113,
    "text": "ふふふ……必ず釣り上げてみせるわ、\nロロライナ・フリクセル……！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3779970044504570002,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "不審者がいるわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "シッ。見ちゃダメ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ここらへんなら人も少なくて釣りしやすそう……あれ？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ヤドヴィガじゃん！\nさっきヴァレリアとキューちゃんが探してたよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "海を見ていたの？　何か、いた？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "……否。ただいつものように\n危険な魔物がいないか海を見ていた",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ふーん。ヤドヴィガは、\nヴァレリアたちと一緒に遊びに行かないの？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "遊びに……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "私には、難しい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "どういうこと？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "この休暇は目的が不明確。\n私は何をするべきか、指示を待っている",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "あー……なるほどねぇ。ふんふん",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "つまり、休暇の過ごし方が分からないと。\nこうやって行楽地に遊びに来るのは初めて？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "……肯定",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ふーむ、そっかそっか……よーし！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "そんじゃあ、アタシたちについてきな！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "休暇の楽しみ方、アタシが案内してあげる！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]